# The art is the screen; a middle-column tap opens the reading menu, which
# names the snapshot freshness and its source.
wait-idle
tap-at 536 724
wait-for Birds
expect Status
expect Updated
expect Source
expect Garden Mac
clean
shot birds-menu
expect Updated just now
expect cannot stay awake for Birds yet
# Refresh in the menu reads the shelf again and puts the art back.
tap Refresh
wait-idle
expect-missing Status
# The cross closes the menu without leaving Birds.
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Status
tap-at 942,560
wait-idle
expect-missing Status
# A page key also refreshes, as a reader would press it.
tap-id refresh
wait-idle
expect-missing No birds yet
# A collage the computer publishes while Birds is open arrives on its own,
# within one ten-second look at the shelf.
companion birds push scripts/fixtures/birds/older.json scripts/fixtures/birds/older.png --sim
wait 11000
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Shed Pi
# A snapshot older than a day says it is out of date.
expect Out of date. Last updated
expect-missing Garden Mac
clean
shot birds-out-of-date
